{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/650506-sealed-exits","id":650506,"title":"Sealed Exits","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-03T13:45:34-07:00","id":650506,"title":"Sealed Exits","content":"Just a quick question; if you invoke the sealed exits lair trait on something does that also mean other people can't break into someplace sealed? And would the whole immunity to your own lair traits mean that someone with that trait could break into a bank vault with it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5257-queshire","name":"Queshire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5257_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"153"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-26T20:01:33-08:00","id":793387,"title":"","content":"Excuse the necromancy here, but this just came up in my own groups discussion. The way I see it is first you couldn't use it to break into a bank vault, but you could use it to break out of one. My case is basically that for individuals who aren't immune to the lair trait that old horror movie thing comes into play where people seem to be able to freely enter the haunted house, but can't get out again afterwords. The Beast being immune means that just this isn't the case for them they can find a window or open the door that sort of thing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-26T22:59:28-08:00","id":793447,"title":"","content":"I wonder how that'd interact with Gift of Warding and the like?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-27T00:48:58-08:00","id":793471,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Hexmeister Vic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/650506-sealed-exits?p=793447#post793447\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder how that'd interact with Gift of Warding and the like?</div> </div> </div> </div>What's Gift of Warding? My friends and I figure that there are still ways of trapping a Beast with the sealed exit lair traits its just trickier than closing and locking all the doors and windows if for no other reason than there are good odds that the Beast will have some other way to get past those. (In our group one of our players has infestation and dragonfire so he laughs if any part of the building can be set on fire or escaped by a countless tiny lizards.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-29T00:24:15-08:00","id":794658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nalak42</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/650506-sealed-exits?p=793471#post793471\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What's Gift of Warding? My friends and I figure that there are still ways of trapping a Beast with the sealed exit lair traits its just trickier than closing and locking all the doors and windows if for no other reason than there are good odds that the Beast will have some other way to get past those. (In our group one of our players has infestation and dragonfire so he laughs if any part of the building can be set on fire or escaped by a countless tiny lizards.)</div> </div> </div> </div>One of the Gifts in W:tF 2.0. Having Sealed Exits would counter All Doors Locked, Maze would counter Maze Ward, and Exposed would counter Boundary Ward. Predator's Claim would not effect a Beast, or its Horror, while Ward the Wolf's Den has Clash built in.<br /> <br /> The takeaway is that Lair Traits are very specific, so using something narratively different from a given Lair Trait is usually enough to thwart it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":1959,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","user":"Hexmeister Vic","date":". 12-29-2015, 03:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}